#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""One-shot D2-17 G02 physical-execution decision driver.

The driver preserves the frozen D2-17 execution package. It supplies the inherited
launcher environment and required evidence-root arguments, verifies all G02
host-only evidence, performs board/serial/baseline checks before the inherited
authorization claim, and then invokes the frozen canonical outer exactly once.
"""
